.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-generate-key 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-generate\-key \- Generates a Secret Key
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop generate\-key\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-signing\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIUSERIDS\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Generates a Secret Key
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor output
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR
Select the profile to use for key generation
.TP
\fB\-\-signing\-only\fR
Create a signing\-only key
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR \fI<WITH_KEY_PASSWORD>\fR
Protect the newly generated key with the given password
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIUSERIDS\fR]
UserIDs for the generated key
